    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 848,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "1. What pain does this kill?\n2. Is it on the request path or a side system?\n3. Is it truth or a copy that can be stale?\n4. Sync (user waits) or async?\n5. What fails on this arrow?\n6. How do we observe it?",
      "originalText": "1. What pain does this kill?\n2. Is it on the request path or a side system?\n3. Is it truth or a copy that can be stale?\n4. Sync (user waits) or async?\n5. What fails on this arrow?\n6. How do we observe it?",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#3c4043",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "id": "ee8bb5b9",
      "versionNonce": 1792429727473,
      "updated": 1792429727473,
      "seed": 1792429727473,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 848,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "HOW TO REUSE\n1. Duplicate this file\n2. Rename system title\n3. Keep columns 1\u20135\n4. Delete boxes with no pain\n5. Trace ONE request with arrows\n6. Draw WRITE solid, READ dashed",
      "originalText": "HOW TO REUSE\n1. Duplicate this file\n2. Rename system title\n3. Keep columns 1\u20135\n4. Delete boxes with no pain\n5. Trace ONE request with arrows\n6. Draw WRITE solid, READ dashed",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#3c4043",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "id": "ca744a25",
      "versionNonce": 1792429727474,
